# Build context = repository root for the gateway images (packages/llm_gateway/Dockerfile,
# services api/worker/flower). Only the three Python packages enter the context:
# without this list, Docker would send the data, caches and experiments (several GB).
# The other images (controller, eqasim, otp) have their own context and do not read this file.
#
# No global `**/…` pattern: it would force BuildKit to walk the whole repository to evaluate it.
*
!packages/llm_gateway/pyproject.toml
!packages/llm_gateway/README.md
!packages/llm_gateway/requirements.txt
!packages/llm_gateway/src
!packages/mobility_core/pyproject.toml
!packages/mobility_core/README.md
!packages/mobility_core/src
!packages/mobility_llm/pyproject.toml
!packages/mobility_llm/README.md
!packages/mobility_llm/src
packages/llm_gateway/src/**/__pycache__
packages/mobility_core/src/**/__pycache__
packages/mobility_llm/src/**/__pycache__
packages/mobility_core/src/mobility_core/data/zf_zones.gpkg
